melody:
Be Thou my vi-sion, O Lord of my heart;
D4 D4 E4/ ~D4/ B3 A3 A3/ ~B3/ D4 D4 E4 F#4(3)
naught be all else to me, save that Thou art;
E4 E4 E4 E4 F#4 A4 B4 A4 F#4 A4(3)
Thou my best thought, by day or by night,
B4 B4/ ~C#5/ D5/ ~C#5/ B4 A4 ~F#4 A4 D4 C#4 B3(2) ~A3
wak-ing or sleep-ing, Thy pres-ence my light.
D4 F#4 A4 B4/ ~A4/ F#4 D4/ ~F#4/ E4 D4 D4 D4(3)
